<ui version="4.0">
 <class>MainWindow</class>
 <widget class="QMainWindow" name="MainWindow">
  <property name="geometry"><rect><x>0</x><y>0</y><width>1024</width><height>600</height></rect></property>
  <property name="windowTitle"><string>SCARA Panel</string></property>
  <widget class="QWidget" name="centralwidget">
   <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="mainLayout">
    <property name="spacing"><number>2</number></property>
    <item><widget class="QLabel" name="lbModeTitle"><property name="text"><string>SCARA 控制系统</string></property></widget></item>
    <item><widget class="QStackedWidget" name="modeStack"/></item>
   </layout>
  </widget>
 </widget>
 <!--
   代码创建的控件清单 (objectName):
   遥控左栏: cardM1,cardM2,cardM3,cardM4,cardSV1,cardSV2
   遥控马达行: slM1,slM2,slM3,slM4,slSV1,slSV2 (QSlider)
   遥控步进: btnM1_m5,btnM1_m1,btnM1_p1,btnM1_p5 (同 M2/M3/M4 模式)
   遥控舵机: btnSV1_m10,btnSV1_m2,btnSV1_p2,btnSV1_p10 (同 SV2)
   遥控EM: btnEM1..btnEM4, btnEstop, btnBack
   数据标签: lbM1Pos,lbM1Cur,lbM1Tmp,lbM1V (同 M2/M3/M4)
   舵机标签: lbSV1Pos,lbSV2Pos
   示教左栏: lbTCur1..lbTCur6 (当前位置M1-M4,SV1,SV2)
   示教按钮: btnPlay(回放), btnTeachBack(返回)
   示教路径表: tblWP (6行8列, 表头:步骤,M1,M3,M4,SV1,(空),M2,(状态))
   示教传送带: lbSeg1..lbSeg4 (段距值), btnSeg1_m..btnSeg4_m, btnSeg1_p..btnSeg4_p
   示教保存: btnSaveStep(保存当前步), btnSubmitAll(提交全部)
   视觉左: camPreview (QLabel, 500x350), camStatus (QLabel)
   视觉右: lbColorResult (QLabel), btnDetect (手动检测)
   安全: 占位
 -->
</ui>
